@startuml
title EduAlto Account and Auth State Diagram

[*] --> PendingVerification : register
PendingVerification --> Active : email OTP verified
PendingVerification --> Locked : too many OTP attempts
PendingVerification --> Disabled : admin disables

Active --> Authenticated : login success
Authenticated --> Active : access token expires
Authenticated --> LoggedOut : logout / refresh token revoked
LoggedOut --> Active

Active --> PasswordResetRequested : forgot password
PasswordResetRequested --> ResetOtpVerified : reset OTP verified
ResetOtpVerified --> Active : password changed
PasswordResetRequested --> Active : reset OTP expired

Active --> Locked : security lock
Locked --> Active : admin unlocks
Active --> Disabled : admin disables
Locked --> Disabled : admin disables
Disabled --> Active : admin re-enables

Disabled --> [*]
@enduml
